			],
			"Message": "style(Echo): Normalize punctuation in README.md — replace em dashes with hyphens\n\nReplace all em dash characters (—) with standard hyphens (-) across the README feature lists, key features section, integration documentation, safety table, and related documentation links. Em dashes were used inconsistently and are neither typographically necessary in a plain-text README nor reliably rendered across all terminal and browser environments.\n\nThis aligns the README with the project's preference for ASCII-only punctuation in documentation files, ensuring consistent rendering regardless of the viewing tool or locale.",
			"SHA": "f4a11fa735af6ab58f5cd4f2b43d923b47bd06d7"
