			],
			"Message": "style(Echo): Reflow documentation and README to consistent line width\n\nRe-wrap paragraphs, table cells, and list items across all three documentation files to eliminate ragged line widths:\n\n- **Architecture.md** — Collapse the overly-wrapped opening paragraph into a single continuous line pair\n- **DeepDive.md** — Reflow the opening paragraph to match the 80-character column convention used in the rest of the document\n- **README.md** — Normalize line breaks across the tagline, feature list, key features, architecture table, connection paths table, component table, integration-with-Mountain table, getting-started sections, dependency table, safety table, compatibility table, and footer links to eliminate orphaned short lines and excessive wrapping\n\nNo functional changes — documentation formatting only.",
