			"Message": "style(Echo): Reflow Rustdoc comments to consistent line width\n\nRe-wrap three doc comments that exceeded or fell short of the project's line width convention:\n\n- `SchedulerBuilder.rs` — Split the 97-character `Default` impl docstring across two lines\n- `Worker.rs` — Reflow the `Run` loop doc paragraph to avoid ragged lines past 80 characters\n- `Task.rs` — Break the `Prioritized` bridging comment to match adjacent comment formatting\n\nAlso removes the `.commit-message.json` staging artifact introduced in 03f7bc1, which was only needed transiently for that commit's tooling workflow and is no longer required.\n\nNo functional changes — documentation formatting only.",
