			"Message": "chore(Echo): Add commit message metadata file\n\nIntroduce `.commit-message.json` to persist the most recent commit message in machine-readable JSON format. This file supports automated tooling workflows that read, audit, or regenerate commit messages from the repository state rather than relying on external storage.\n\nNo functional changes to the library — scaffolding only.",
